// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// FLIGHT HISTORY FUSION
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// When today's ADB data is thin (no reg, no operator), fall back to what
// the last 14 days say. This isn't a guess — it's what ADB has observed
// for this same flight on prior days.
//
// CONFIDENCE THRESHOLD: a value only fills in if it was observed on at
// least 60% of the historical days that had any data for that field.
// Ambiguous routes (e.g., 7/14 Jazz, 7/14 mainline) leave the field empty
// — honest about the uncertainty.
//
// CACHE: 6 hours. History doesn't change retroactively, so long cache is fine.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
var _historyCache = {};
